### Requests through Nginx (http://localhost:8090), like the browser.
### Swagger UI: http://localhost:8081/swagger-ui.html

### Risk estimate as a guest: nothing is saved ("saved": false). Lab values in mmol/L.
POST http://localhost:8090/api/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "male": 0,
  "age": 54,
  "education": 2,
  "currentSmoker": 0,
  "cigsPerDay": 0,
  "BPMeds": 0,
  "prevalentStroke": 0,
  "prevalentHyp": 0,
  "diabetes": 0,
  "totChol": 6.0,
  "sysBP": 138.0,
  "diaBP": 86.0,
  "BMI": 27.4,
  "heartRate": 76.0,
  "glucose": 5.1
}

### Same with the reduced model (ignores totChol and glucose)
POST http://localhost:8090/api/assessments?modelKey=logistic-regression-reduced
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "male": 1, "age": 61, "education": 1, "currentSmoker": 1, "cigsPerDay": 20, "BPMeds": 0,
  "prevalentStroke": 0, "prevalentHyp": 1, "diabetes": 0, "totChol": 6.2, "sysBP": 152.0,
  "diaBP": 94.0, "BMI": 29.1, "heartRate": 80.0, "glucose": 5.6
}

### The requests below need a user's access token. Easiest way to get one: log in at
### http://localhost:8090, open DevTools > Network, and copy the "Authorization: Bearer ..."
### header of an /api request. It is valid for 5 minutes.
@token = paste-the-access-token-here

### Estimate as a logged-in user: saved to the journal ("saved": true, "entryId")
POST http://localhost:8090/api/assessments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "male": 0, "age": 54, "education": 2, "currentSmoker": 0, "cigsPerDay": 0, "BPMeds": 0,
  "prevalentStroke": 0, "prevalentHyp": 0, "diabetes": 0, "totChol": 6.0, "sysBP": 138.0,
  "diaBP": 86.0, "BMI": 27.4, "heartRate": 76.0, "glucose": 5.1
}

### Own journal, newest first
GET http://localhost:8090/api/journal?size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete an own entry (replace the id with an entryId); another user's entry answers 404
DELETE http://localhost:8090/api/journal/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without a token the journal answers 401
GET http://localhost:8090/api/journal

### Health
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
